Lemma stat_open :
  1 <= Z.of_nat (length bs) /\ lo + BPUT_STACK <= bv_unsigned sp /\ aceil <= lo
  /\ P mod 8 = 0 /\ E mod 8 = 0 /\ (P + PARSER_SIZE <= E \/ E + 24 <= P)
  /\ (p0 + Z.of_nat (length bs) <= P \/ P + PARSER_SIZE <= p0) /\ (p0 + Z.of_nat (length bs) <= E \/ E + 24 <= p0)
  /\ bv_unsigned sp mod 16 = 0 /\ bv_unsigned sp <= shi
  /\ Z.of_nat (length bs) <= R /\ bv_unsigned sp <= B /\ tp = Z_to_bv 64 ATP /\ MX <= as_LIVE_MAX H /\ CX <= as_LIVE_CNT_MAX H.
Proof. open_X. destruct STAT as ((A1 & A2 & A3 & A4 & A5 & A6 & A7 & A8 & A9 & A10) & B1 & B2 & B3 & B4 & B5). repeat split; assumption. Qed.
